    "A JSON object merged into every request, such as {\"provider\": {\"sort\": \"throughput\"}}." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un objet JSON fusionné dans chaque requête, par exemple {\"provider\": {\"sort\": \"throughput\"}}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom endpoint needs its document: start from the example." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un endpoint personnalisé a besoin de son document : partez de l’exemple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A development server often signs its own certificate. Continue only if it is yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un serveur de développement signe souvent son propre certificat. Ne continuez que s’il est le vôtre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A finished session shows its last output, and can be restarted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une session terminée affiche sa dernière sortie, et peut être relancée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A local log of what the application did, never of what you typed, kept for two weeks. Exported only when you save it yourself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un journal local de ce qu’a fait l’application, jamais de ce que vous avez saisi, conservé deux semaines. Exporté seulement quand vous l’enregistrez vous-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new version is downloaded in the background and installed the next time you quit Vibe Manager. Turned off, you are told first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une nouvelle version est téléchargée en arrière-plan et installée la prochaine fois que vous quittez Vibe Manager. Sinon, vous êtes prévenu d’abord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page of this Mac: the agent may act on it without asking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une page de ce Mac : l’agent peut y agir sans demander."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A process from that run may still be running (pid %@) and was left alone; check Activity Monitor." : {
      "comment" : "Process identifiers, separated by commas.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un processus de cette exécution tourne peut-être encore (pid %@) et n’a pas été touché ; vérifiez dans le Moniteur d’activité."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A regular expression, with named captures such as (?<number>[0-9]+)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une expression régulière, avec des captures nommées comme (?<number>[0-9]+)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A template can propose the folder, the name and the appearance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un gabarit peut proposer le dossier, le nom et l’apparence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A template is a prompt with fields to fill in — “Review {{url}}” — ready to start a session from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un gabarit prépare une session : son prompt, avec des champs à remplir — « Revue {{url}} » —, et au besoin son dossier, son nom et son apparence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A template’s prompt takes no files" : {
      "comment" : "Over the new session's draft, while files are dragged over it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le prompt d’un gabarit ne prend pas de fichiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A transcript is no longer found; what it reported until %@ is kept." : {
      "comment" : "A date and time.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un transcript est introuvable ; ce qu’il indiquait jusqu’au %@ est conservé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A value to try" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une valeur à essayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zip archive dropped on the list is imported: one image per expression (neutral.png, pleased.png…)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une archive .zip déposée sur la liste est importée : une image par expression (neutral.png, pleased.png…)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: a colour, by its hex code.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couleur %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account to check" : {
      "comment" : "The title of a request of an agent: its CLI is signed out, refused or unpaid, and the turn stopped.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compte à vérifier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity" : {
      "comment" : "A section of the inspector.\nA tab of the Settings window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Examples" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter les exemples"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Colour" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter une couleur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Header" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter un en-tête"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Rule" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter une règle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Symbol" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter un symbole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a model that can call tools: read them from the endpoint, or type one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajoutez un modèle qui sait appeler des outils : lisez-les depuis l’endpoint, ou saisissez-en un."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a resolver" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter un résolveur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an Endpoint…" : {
      "comment" : "The last line of the endpoints in the Settings window's sidebar.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter un endpoint…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to To Do" : {
      "comment" : "Creates a session without launching it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajouter à À faire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address pattern" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Motif d’adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avancé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each turn, the session's agent writes a short summary of what it did, with the same account, the lightest model it offers and at most one summary every five minutes. The tickets, requests, branches and worktrees used are listed either way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Après chaque tour, l’agent de la session écrit un court résumé de ce qu’il a fait, avec le même compte, son modèle le plus léger et au plus un résumé toutes les cinq minutes. Les tickets, requêtes, branches et worktrees utilisés sont listés dans tous les cas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the previous request of this session." : {
      "comment" : "Why a request cannot be answered yet: another request of its session comes first.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Après la demande précédente de cette session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent" : {
      "comment" : "The coding agent the session runs.\nThe heading of the session's agent.\nWhat the Usage window groups its figures by.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent Actions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actions de l’agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent switched" : {
      "comment" : "The title of the line a terminal shows above an agent that replaced another.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changement d’agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent unavailable" : {
      "comment" : "A session's state, in the sidebar.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent indisponible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents" : {
      "comment" : "A group of the Settings window's sidebar.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agents"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents kept running go on working in the background, and are back on screen as they are the next time Vibe Manager is opened. A restart of the Mac stops them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les agents laissés en cours d’exécution continuent de travailler en arrière-plan, et réapparaissent tels quels à la prochaine ouverture de Vibe Manager. Un redémarrage du Mac les arrête."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents run inside Vibe Manager for now. Quit and reopen Vibe Manager to give them the access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour l’instant, les agents tournent dans Vibe Manager lui-même. Quittez puis rouvrez Vibe Manager pour leur donner l’accès."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents running when an update is installed keep running if you choose to: you are asked first, as when quitting, and they are back on screen after the relaunch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les agents en cours au moment d’installer une mise à jour continuent de tourner si vous le choisissez : la question vous est posée d’abord, comme en quittant, et vous les retrouvez à l’écran après la relance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All time" : {
      "comment" : "A period of the Usage window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Depuis toujours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow" : {
      "comment" : "Allows what an agent asks, this once.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autoriser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Full Disk Access…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autoriser l’accès complet au disque…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Once" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autoriser une fois"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow exporting as CSV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permettre l’export CSV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow in This Session" : {
      "comment" : "A button of the web view's question: lets the agent read the site until the session ends.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autoriser pour cette session"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed" : {
      "comment" : "An agent action the user allowed once.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autorisé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed · %@" : {
      "comment" : "Said once an agent's request was allowed from the palette.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autorisé · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also interrupts the agent's turn: it waits for your next message." : {
      "comment" : "What refusing a request from the palette does besides refusing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interrompt aussi le tour de l’agent : il attend votre prochain message."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also looked in: %@" : {
      "comment" : "A list of folders the agent visited that are not repositories.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autres dossiers consultés : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also when an agent stops. Only while Vibe Manager is not in front." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aussi quand un agent s’arrête. Seulement quand Vibe Manager n’est pas au premier plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always" : {
      "comment" : "Allows what an agent asks, from now on.\nAn agent action allowed by Always Allow.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toujours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always Allow for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toujours autoriser pour %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always allow %@ everywhere" : {
      "comment" : "A button answering an agent's permission. The argument lists what is allowed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toujours autoriser %@ partout"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always allow %@ for this session" : {
      "comment" : "A button answering an agent's permission. The argument lists what is allowed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toujours autoriser %@ pour cette session"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always allow %@ in this project" : {
      "comment" : "A button answering an agent's permission. The argument lists what is allowed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toujours autoriser %@ dans ce projet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always allowed sites" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sites toujours autorisés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An address and its protocol" : {
      "comment" : "Under Other Server, among the servers a new endpoint starts from.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une adresse et son protocole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent is asking for something" : {
      "comment" : "A notification whose details are hidden, on the lock screen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un agent demande quelque chose"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An endpoint is a model server reachable over HTTP, on this Mac or in the cloud. Its models then appear beside Claude Code and Codex when you create a session, driven by one of them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un endpoint est un serveur de modèles joignable en HTTP, sur ce Mac ou dans le cloud. Ses modèles apparaissent ensuite à côté de Claude Code et Codex quand vous créez une session, pilotés par l’un d’eux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated preview of the avatar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aperçu animé de l’avatar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another copy of Vibe Manager (pid %@) is running these sessions." : {
      "comment" : "The process identifier of the other copy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une autre copie de Vibe Manager (pid %@) exécute ces sessions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another copy of Vibe Manager is running these sessions. Nothing was restored or changed here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une autre copie de Vibe Manager exécute ces sessions. Rien n’a été restauré ni modifié ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another launch started this session in the meantime." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un autre lancement a démarré cette session entre-temps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer after the tool" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Réponse après l’outil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer this question in the session." : {
      "comment" : "Why a request is answered in its terminal: its CLI never says when its dialog is shown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Répondez à cette question dans la session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered in %lld ms." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A répondu en %lld ms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered · %@" : {
      "comment" : "Said once an agent's question was answered from the palette.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
