            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le personnage de « %@ » n’a pas la taille des autres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The coding agent that runs the sessions: its tools, its prompts and its permissions. The gateway translates between its protocol and the endpoint's." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
